OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVariable amounts of cloud and
OL,6,Fsome bright or sunny spells. A few
OL,7,Fshowers around, these gradually
OL,8,Fbecoming fewer during the afternoon.
OL,9,FFreshening northwesterly winds during
OL,10,Fthe afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FDry with some late brightness
OL,13,Fthis evening. Then the rest of the
OL,14,Fnight will be mainly dry with just the
OL,15,Flight shower. Fresh to strong north to
OL,16,Fnorthwesterly winds.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FIt will be a dry day with
OL,19,Fsome bright or sunny spells.
OL,20,FNorthwesterly winds soon easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
