OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Ffor most of Thursday but rain during
OL,7,Fthe evening. Bright spells and the odd
OL,8,Fshower on Friday. Rain likely on
OL,9,FSaturday.
